  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "收购、摆放与升级列车车厢，以布局持续生产幸福值",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Acquire, place, and upgrade train cars to generate Happiness, and make decisive choices to determine the direction your train will take.",
