      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "列车协同组合数百件神器，幸福值越高统治权越稳固",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Combine a wide range of train synergies with hundreds of powerful artifacts to generate more Happiness. Greater Happiness will further solidify your authority within the train society.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3690490/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "穿越数十个地标选择最佳路线，带领末日列车乘客求生",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Travel through dozens of landmarks across diverse environments, find the optimal route, and guide your passengers to survival.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3690490/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
